            "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"et-benefits\">\n  <p class=\"et-benefits-heading\">\n    Tired of puffy under-eye bags that make you look worn out, even after a full night's sleep? This tightening eye film dries in minutes and smooths the look of bags and fine lines for up to 16 hours.\n  </p>\n\n  <div class=\"et-benefits-grid\">\n    <div class=\"et-benefit\">\n      <div class=\"et-benefit-icon\">\n        <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1a1a1a\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n          <path d=\"M19 9c0-3.5-3-6-7-6-3.2 0-5.8 1.7-6.7 4.2L3 8.5V12h2l1 2v2h3v-1.5h4V16h3v-3l1.5-1.2C18.4 11 19 10.1 19 9z\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"8\" r=\"1\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\" stroke=\"none\"/>\n          <path d=\"M8 9l-1.5-1.5\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"et-benefit-text\">Stop wasting money on eye creams that change nothing</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"et-benefit\">\n      <div class=\"et-benefit-icon\">\n        <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1a1a1a\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n          <circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"12\" r=\"7\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"7.5\" cy=\"10.5\" r=\"0.8\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\" stroke=\"none\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"12.5\" cy=\"10.5\" r=\"0.8\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\" stroke=\"none\"/>\n          <path d=\"M7.5 14c0.8 1 2 1.5 2.5 1.5s1.7-0.5 2.5-1.5\"/>\n          <path d=\"M17 8v4M15 10h4\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"et-benefit-text\">Look fresh and awake, even on your most tired days</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"et-benefit\">\n      <div class=\"et-benefit-icon\">\n        <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1a1a1a\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n          <path d=\"M12 3c3 4 6 7.5 6 11a6 6 0 0